OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I had anxiety but it
OL,4,Aturned out to be breast cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who said she was told by a GP
OL,7,Fshe may be experiencing "medical
OL,8,Fanxiety" after finding a lump in her
OL,9,Fbreast was later diagnosed with cancer.
OL,11,FBeth Jenkins, 42, visited a locum GP at
OL,12,Fher practice with concerns that a lump
OL,13,Fon her right breast had grown
OL,14,Fsignificantly and said she was told she
OL,15,Fwas "too young to have breast cancer"
OL,16,Fand it may be linked to postnatal
OL,17,Fdepression instead.
OL,19,FHowever, it was lobular breast cancer,
OL,20,Fwith a 5cm (2in) tumour and the disease
OL,21,Fhad spread to three lymph nodes.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
