OL,3,GNEWSAI was told I had anxiety but it
OL,4,Aturned out to be breast cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPractice 1 Keir Hardie Health Park said
OL,7,Fit could not discuss individual cases
OL,8,Fbut encouraged patients to "make a
OL,9,Fsecond appointment" if they had
OL,10,Fconcerns about their health or care.
